# Cloudflare Pages static-asset headers (does not affect /api or /media Functions).
# The page must always be revalidated: it carries the ?v=<hash> stamps on the JS/CSS
# links (stamp_assets.py), so a fresh index.html is what makes new code load on a
# normal reload. A stale cached copy would keep pointing at the old files.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
